-- spec 12.R2: a model or library (x.lut) holds definitions and their laws, and neither a `test` line nor `main`.
-- Written 2026-10-16 by Claude Opus 5.5, an agent of the coordinating session, on record/IA/code-follows-2026-10-16/prompt-file-kinds.md (D-2026-10-16-e).

double (k : Int) : Int := k + k
DoublesIsTwice (k : Int) : Bool := double k == 2 * k
